    <bpmn:process id="W_W4946" name="W4946. Import Document Release Against Trust Receipt &amp; Goods-in-Trust Establishment" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Import arrival &amp; clearance (VS-02.2/VS-87); bank document release request
Frequency: Per import shipment (~400–600 TEUs/month; ~10–15 regulated shipments)
Volume: ~1 TR per shipment/lc × import volume
Owner: ABL &amp; Collateral Operations Manager / Import Finance / Treasury
Participants: Import/Customs (VS-02.2/VS-87), AP (VS-15.1), Treasury (VS-18), DC Ops (VS-04), Legal (VS-100)
Source: workflow W4946 — Import Document Release Against Trust Receipt &amp; Goods-in-Trust Establishment</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4946_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4946_Lane1" name="Import Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4946_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4946_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4946_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4946_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4946_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4946_Start3" name="Import arrival &amp; clearance (VS-02.2/VS-87); bank document release request">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4946_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4946_Task4" name="On import arrival &amp; customs clearance (VS-02.2 W144/W464, VS-87), request the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: On import arrival &amp; customs clearance (VS-02.2 W144/W464, VS-87), request the bank release the shipping documents (BL, invoice, LC) against execution of a trust receipt: execute the TR instrument (W4945), acknowledge goods held in trust for the bank, and take physical/constructive possession for sale/manufacture per the TR terms
Responsible (R): Import Finance / Treasury / Legal
Accountable (A): Treasurer
Duration: Per shipment</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4946_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4946_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4946_Task5" name="Establish goods-in-trust: receive the documents, post the inventory as…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Establish goods-in-trust: receive the documents, post the inventory as goods-in-trust status (distinct from owned — links VS-05/VS-29), record the TR obligation (principal + interest/charges), and stage at the DC (VS-04) under the segregated status
Responsible (R): Import Finance / DC Ops / Treasury / IT
Accountable (A): ABL Manager
Duration: Per shipment</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4946_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4946_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4946_Task6" name="Settle the import costs &amp; integrate: settle customs duty (VS-15.1 W239)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Settle the import costs &amp; integrate: settle customs duty (VS-15.1 W239), freight/demurrage (W249), and the LC (W232); record the trust-receipt receivable payable to the bank; and trigger proceeds tracking (W4947) and remittance scheduling (W4948)
Responsible (R): Import Finance / AP / Treasury
Accountable (A): Treasurer
Duration: Per shipment</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4946_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4946_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4946_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4946_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-741 (ensure controlled execution — Trust-Receipt, Warehouse-Receipt &amp; Import Inventory Financing Operations (PA-170.2).) | - CTL-741: TR executed per template; goods-in-trust status enforced; TR-payable recorded; cost-settlement reconciled
Owner: ABL &amp; Collateral Operations Manager / Import Finance / Treasury</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4946_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4946_Annotation8" targetRef="W4946_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4946_Flow10" sourceRef="W4946_Start3" targetRef="W4946_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4946_Flow11" sourceRef="W4946_Task4" targetRef="W4946_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4946_Flow12" sourceRef="W4946_Task5" targetRef="W4946_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4946_Flow13" sourceRef="W4946_Task6" targetRef="W4946_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
