    <bpmn:process id="W_W4948" name="W4948. Trust-Receipt Proceeds Remittance &amp; Release Lifecycle" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: TR remittance due date (per term); trust-goods fully sold; maturity
Frequency: Per TR (event-driven)
Volume: ~1 remittance/release per TR × import volume (~400–600 TEUs/month → hundreds of TRs/yr)
Owner: ABL &amp; Collateral Operations Manager / Treasury / Finance
Participants: Treasury (VS-18), Finance (VS-17), AP (VS-15), Legal (VS-100), Data (VS-28)
Source: workflow W4948 — Trust-Receipt Proceeds Remittance &amp; Release Lifecycle</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4948_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4948_Lane1" name="Treasury">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4948_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4948_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4948_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4948_Lane2" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4948_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4948_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4948_Start4" name="TR remittance due date (per term); trust-goods fully sold; maturity">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4948_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4948_Task5" name="Remit proceeds to the bank per the TR term (sell-and-remit on sale, or…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Remit proceeds to the bank per the TR term (sell-and-remit on sale, or hold-and-pay at maturity): draw from the segregated proceeds (W4947), settle the TR-payable (principal + interest/charges), reconcile to the bank, and record the release of the corresponding trust-goods from trust status
Responsible (R): Treasury / Finance / AP
Accountable (A): Treasurer
Duration: Per TR</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4948_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4948_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4948_Task6" name="Release the inventory from goods-in-trust to owned status: once the TR is…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Release the inventory from goods-in-trust to owned status: once the TR is settled, reclassify the remaining/sold trust goods to owned inventory (links VS-05/VS-29), update the inventory valuation/ownership, and release the bank&#x27;s security interest in that shipment
Responsible (R): Finance / Inventory / Treasury
Accountable (A): ABL Manager
Duration: Per TR</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4948_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4948_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4948_Task7" name="Close the TR &amp; document: archive the TR instrument, settlement evidence, and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Close the TR &amp; document: archive the TR instrument, settlement evidence, and release; report to the bank; feed availability (W4942), the borrowing base (W4939), and audit (VS-21); manage exceptions (short-pay, unsold trust goods at maturity → rollover/cash-settle per agreement)
Responsible (R): Treasury / Finance / Legal / Internal Audit
Accountable (A): Treasurer
Duration: Per TR</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4948_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4948_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4948_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4948_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-741 (ensure controlled execution — Trust-Receipt, Warehouse-Receipt &amp; Import Inventory Financing Operations (PA-170.2).) | - CTL-741: proceeds remitted on term; TR-payable settled &amp; bank-reconciled; inventory released on settlement; exceptions managed; audited (VS-21)
Owner: ABL &amp; Collateral Operations Manager / Treasury / Finance</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4948_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4948_Annotation9" targetRef="W4948_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
