      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4949_Start5" name="Warehouse-receipt collateral arrangement; ABL inventory pledge over DC stock">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4949_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4949_Task6" name="Establish warehouse-receipt / field-warehousing collateral: where the bank…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Establish warehouse-receipt / field-warehousing collateral: where the bank requires a collateral manager/warehouse-receipt structure over designated DC inventory (distinct from trust-receipt import financing), set up the warehouse receipts, the designated/collateralized bin/zone, the collateral-manager or field-warehousing arrangement, and the access/segregation controls
Responsible (R): ABL Manager / Legal / Treasury / DC Ops
Accountable (A): Treasurer / Legal
Duration: Per arrangement</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4949_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4949_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4949_Task7" name="Operate collateralized-inventory controls: maintain the designated collateral…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Operate collateralized-inventory controls: maintain the designated collateral pool, control releases (no release without authorization W4952), reconcile receipts/issues, and support periodic bank/collateral-manager counts (links VS-05.1 W6/W42)
Responsible (R): DC Ops / Inventory / ABL Manager
Accountable (A): ABL Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4949_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4949_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4949_Task8" name="Verify &amp; report: periodic verification of warehouse-receipt collateral vs the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Verify &amp; report: periodic verification of warehouse-receipt collateral vs the inventory ledger, report to the bank/collateral-manager, manage substitutions/releases (W4952), and feed the borrowing base (W4939) and availability (W4942)
Responsible (R): Finance / Inventory / Treasury / Analytics
Accountable (A): Treasurer
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4949_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4949_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4949_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
