        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-741 (ensure controlled execution — Trust-Receipt, Warehouse-Receipt &amp; Import Inventory Financing Operations (PA-170.2).) | - CTL-741: designated collateral pool; release-authorization enforced; periodic count; reconciled to ledger; TPRM on collateral manager (VS-161)
Owner: ABL &amp; Collateral Operations Manager / Treasury / DC Ops</bpmn:text>
