    <bpmn:process id="W_W4950" name="W4950. Import-Inventory-In-Transit Financing &amp; Pre-Shipment / LC Settlement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Import PO &amp; LC issuance (VS-15.1 W232); pre-shipment financing need
Frequency: Per import shipment
Volume: ~400–600 TEUs/month × in-transit financing
Owner: ABL &amp; Collateral Operations Manager / Import Finance / Treasury
Participants: Import/Customs (VS-02.2/VS-87), AP (VS-15.1), Treasury (VS-18), Finance (VS-17)
Source: workflow W4950 — Import-Inventory-In-Transit Financing &amp; Pre-Shipment / LC Settlement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4950_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4950_Lane1" name="Import Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4950_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4950_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4950_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4950_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4950_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4950_Start3" name="Import PO &amp; LC issuance (VS-15.1 W232); pre-shipment financing need">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4950_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4950_Task4" name="Finance the in-transit/pre-shipment stage: from LC issuance (VS-15.1 W232)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Finance the in-transit/pre-shipment stage: from LC issuance (VS-15.1 W232) through ocean transit (45–90 days) to arrival, fund the LC/supplier payment via the import line, classify the in-transit inventory for borrowing-base eligibility (W4938), and track the in-transit position (links VS-02.3 control tower W250)
Responsible (R): Import Finance / Treasury / Supply Chain
Accountable (A): Treasurer
Duration: Per shipment</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4950_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4950_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4950_Task5" name="Settle the pre-shipment/LC: draw on the facility for the LC/supplier, settle…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Settle the pre-shipment/LC: draw on the facility for the LC/supplier, settle freight forwarder (VS-02.2), and accumulate landed cost (links VS-158 landed-cost) pending the trust-receipt release (W4946) at arrival; track the financing cost (interest/charges) into the import cost
Responsible (R): Import Finance / AP / Treasury / Costing
Accountable (A): Treasurer
Duration: Per shipment</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4950_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4950_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4950_Task6" name="Transition to trust receipt at arrival: on arrival &amp; clearance, transition the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Transition to trust receipt at arrival: on arrival &amp; clearance, transition the in-transit financing to the trust-receipt (W4946), reconcile the pre-shipment draws, and update availability (W4942) and the borrowing base (W4939)
Responsible (R): Import Finance / Treasury / Finance
Accountable (A): Treasurer
Duration: Per shipment</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4950_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4950_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4950_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4950_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-741 (ensure controlled execution — Trust-Receipt, Warehouse-Receipt &amp; Import Inventory Financing Operations (PA-170.2).) | - CTL-741: in-transit eligibility per agreement; financing cost in landed cost; transition reconciled; availability updated
Owner: ABL &amp; Collateral Operations Manager / Import Finance / Treasury</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
