    <bpmn:process id="W_W4951" name="W4951. Inventory Pledge Perfection, Registration &amp; Security Documentation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Facility close (W4937); new collateral; legal/perfection requirement
Frequency: Per facility + on collateral change
Volume: 1 security/pledge structure per facility × inventory/AR/collateral classes
Owner: ABL &amp; Collateral Operations Manager / Legal / Treasury
Participants: Legal (VS-100), Treasury (VS-18), Finance (VS-17), Compliance (VS-22)
Source: workflow W4951 — Inventory Pledge Perfection, Registration &amp; Security Documentation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4951_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4951_Lane1" name="Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4951_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4951_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4951_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4951_Lane2" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4951_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4951_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4951_Start4" name="Facility close (W4937); new collateral; legal/perfection requirement">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4951_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4951_Task5" name="Perfect the security interest over inventory/AR per Philippine law (Civil Code…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Perfect the security interest over inventory/AR per Philippine law (Civil Code pledge, personal-property collateral concepts, the security documents in W4937): execute the pledge/security agreement, any required notices/registration, and ensure enforceability against third parties; manage the multi-entity guarantor/pledgor structure (VS-72)
Responsible (R): Legal / ABL Manager / Treasury
Accountable (A): CFO / Legal
Duration: Per facility</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4951_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4951_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4951_Task6" name="Maintain the security documentation: the security/pledge register, the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Maintain the security documentation: the security/pledge register, the perfection evidence, the collateral descriptions (inventory classes, locations, AR), and the bank&#x27;s lien positions; update on collateral changes (new locations VS-37/VS-109, new entities, releases)
Responsible (R): Legal / ABL Manager / Finance
Accountable (A): Legal
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4951_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4951_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4951_Task7" name="Govern encumbrance disclosure &amp; compliance: disclose encumbered assets in the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Govern encumbrance disclosure &amp; compliance: disclose encumbered assets in the PFRS notes (links VS-17.4), manage covenant/registration compliance, and support external audit (VS-21) and Legal review on enforceability
Responsible (R): Finance / Legal / Internal Audit
Accountable (A): CFO / Controller
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4951_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4951_End8" name="Complete">
