    <bpmn:process id="W_W4952" name="W4952. Pledged-Inventory Movement, Location Control &amp; Release Authorization" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Inventory movement/transfer (VS-05.2); sale (W4947); release request; collateral substitution
Frequency: Continuous (per movement/release)
Volume: ~10–20% of ~134M annual POS line items + transfers tied to pledged/collateralized inventory
Owner: ABL &amp; Collateral Operations Manager / DC Ops / Finance
Participants: DC/Store Ops (VS-04/VS-07), Inventory (VS-05), Treasury (VS-18), Finance (VS-17)
Source: workflow W4952 — Pledged-Inventory Movement, Location Control &amp; Release Authorization</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4952_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4952_Lane1" name="DC Ops">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4952_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4952_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4952_Lane2" name="ABL Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4952_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4952_Lane3" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4952_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4952_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4952_Start5" name="Inventory movement/transfer (VS-05.2); sale (W4947); release request; collateral…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4952_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4952_Task6" name="Control pledged/collateralized-inventory movement: gate transfers (VS-05.2 W22)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Control pledged/collateralized-inventory movement: gate transfers (VS-05.2 W22) and inter-DC moves (W218) of pledged/collateralized stock against the facility/location rules, prevent movement to ineligible locations, and maintain the location/encumbrance register (W4951)
Responsible (R): DC Ops / Inventory / ABL Manager
Accountable (A): ABL Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4952_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4952_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4952_Task7" name="Authorize releases &amp; substitutions: release collateralized inventory only on…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Authorize releases &amp; substitutions: release collateralized inventory only on authorized sale (W4947 — with proceeds segregation) or authorized substitution (replace with equivalent eligible collateral), maintain the dual-control release authorization, and reconcile releases to the borrowing base (W4939)
Responsible (R): ABL Manager / Treasury / DC Ops
Accountable (A): Treasurer
Duration: Per release</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4952_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4952_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4952_Task8" name="Reconcile &amp; report: reconcile pledged/collateralized inventory movements to the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Reconcile &amp; report: reconcile pledged/collateralized inventory movements to the ledger and the borrowing base, report location/movement exceptions, and support the field exam (W4943) and availability (W4942)
Responsible (R): Finance / Inventory / Analytics / ABL Manager
Accountable (A): Treasurer
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4952_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4952_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4952_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4952_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-741 (ensure controlled execution — Trust-Receipt, Warehouse-Receipt &amp; Import Inventory Financing Operations (PA-170.2).) | - CTL-741: movement gated by eligibility; release dual-authorized; substitution equivalent; reconciled to borrowing base; audited (W4943)
Owner: ABL &amp; Collateral Operations Manager / DC Ops / Finance</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
